      "value": "<p>The Black Widow is a semi-automatic refinement of the M-98 Widow, trading a fraction of its predecessor's per-shot devastation for a three-round heat sink that allows follow-up shots without a full heat sink swap. It retains the Widow's anti-materiel velocity and its ability to end most living things with a single correctly placed round - the added capacity simply means a miss need not be fatal to the shooter.</p>"
